(NAME ) Tj
/F00 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 102.0 749.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(MARC::Doc::Tutorial - A documentation-only module for new users of MARC::Record ) Tj
/F21 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.0 731.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(SYNOPSIS ) Tj
/F10 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 102.0 711.2 Tm
