(when there are no more records left in the file, which causes the ) Tj
/F10 10 Tf
0.9705 Tw
(while) Tj
/F00 10 Tf
0.9705 Tw
( loop to end. This is a useful) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 746.0 Tm
