1 0 0 1 102.0 107.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(  19 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 95.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(  20   \} ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 83.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(  21 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 71.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
